<title>ROMANIA: TENNIS-DUTCH STRIKE BACK AGAINST ROMANIA.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DUTCH STRIKE BACK AGAINST ROMANIA.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania led the Netherlands 2-1 in their Davis Cup World Group first round match on Saturday after the Dutch, 2-0 down overnight, won the doubles.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Ion Moldovan/Razvan Sabau (Romania) lost to Paul Haarhuis/Jacco Eltingh (Netherlands) 6-7 (4-7) 4-6 3-6</p>
</text>
